---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects - Eran Gamage">
  <section class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">Projects</h1>
    <p class="muted-copy">
      A small set of research and applied data science projects across retrieval systems, energy analytics, privacy-preserving protocols, and climate modelling.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">RAG / NLP</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Investor Assistant RAG</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">A retrieval system for answering questions about ASX companies with attention to provenance and evaluation.</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <li>Python embeddings, RAG evaluation, and Streamlit interface work.</li>
        <li><a class="link" href="https://github.com/rmit-ds-investor-assistant" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub organization</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">Energy analytics</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">GridAI - Australian Grid Analytics</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">Forecasting and analysis on AEMO Dispatch SCADA and demand datasets.</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <li>Random forest and XGBoost baselines.</li>
        <li>Time-aware validation and reproducible data workflows.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">Privacy</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">UBT / Private Retrieval (ZK)</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">Exploration of PIR-style private queries, proofs of innocence, subtree structures, and BLAKE3-oriented retrieval design.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">Climate modelling</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Deep Learning for Drought (Sri Lanka)</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 muted-copy">RNN and ANN models for SPEI indices, focused on long-term drought prediction and climate risk analysis.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
